 "insight": [
  "Luxembourg's exports increased in the first half of 2026.",
  "They started at 1.40 billion euros in January and rose to 1.49 billion euros by June, a growth of 6.6%.",
  "The highest export value was in March 2026, reaching 1.54 billion euros.",
  "This shows a steady upward trend in exports during this period.",
  "The data are in current euros and do not account for price changes over time."
